    "3.7",
    "Generic file extension for a file stored on a Microsoft IIS-based Web server; often used by.PDF files, but may also be used by several other file types. Clicking on a link ending in .epibrw may display the file directly in a browser window or may initiate a download of the file. Windows Any Web browser Mac Any Web browser.",
