    ".CRL",
    "Certificate Revocation List File",
    "3.3",
    "Data file typically used by Web servers and encryption software; contains a blacklist of revoked digital certificates; stores information about the certificates, such as the issuer and the revocation date; enables security administrators to block untrusted entities. Windows Microsoft IIS. Citrix NetScaler. OpenSSL. Mac Globus Toolkit. OpenSSL. Linux Citrix NetScaler. Globus Toolkit. OpenSSLFree.",
