    ".SHTM",
    "HTML Server Side Include File",
    "3.3",
    "Web page that can reference other files on the Web server; similar to a standard HTML document, but can access other files on the server when loaded; allows a standard HTML file to be somewhat dynamic. HTML Server Side Include files more commonly use the.SHTML file extension. Windows Adobe Dreamweaver 2021. Microsoft Internet Explorer. Other Web browser Microsoft Notepad Included with OS. Other text editor Mac Adobe Dreamweaver 2021. Apple Safari Included with OS. Other Web browser Apple TextEdit Included with OS. Other text editor.",
