    ".DML",
    "DynaScript File",
    "3.3",
    "Web script written in DynaScript, a specialized Dynamic HTML scripting language; contains code that can be used to dynamically generate HTML; may be executed on any Web server that has DynaScript installed. DML pages are similar to ColdFusion (.CFM) and Active Server (.ASP) pages. The DynaScript language uses a C-oriented syntax and supports Intelligent Objects, which can help reduce the development time of Web applications. Windows View in a Web browser Mac View in a Web browser Linux View in a Web browser.",
