    "Xara Web Designer Graphic",
    "3.1",
    "Image created by Xara Web Designer (formerly Xara Webstyle), a visual Web page design application; stores a Web graphic in a proprietary format; may be a banner, navbar, logo, button, background, photo, or another image type; typically built from a Webstyle template. NOTE: MAGIX acquired Xara in 2007 and released Xara Web Designer as the successor to Xara Webstyle. Windows MAGIX Xara Web Designer.",
