    ".JHTML",
    "Java HTML Web Page",
    "3.1",
    "HTML file that includes Java code; similar to a standard.HTML file, but may include Java functions that are processed on the server before the page is sent to the clients Web browser; can also access information from a database using a JDBC (Java Database Connectivity) connection. JHTML files may be created using the ATG (Art Technology Group) Dynamo Document Editor and may be parsed on a Web server with the Dynamo Application Server installed. Dynamo is now part of the ATG Commerce software package. Windows View with any Web browser Mac View with any Web browser Linux Edit and run with ATG Commerce software.",
