    "3.1",
    "Text presentation streamed from the Internet, often via the Web using the RealPlayer plug-in; may be a text-only stream, or may be combined with an audio or video media stream. Windows RealNetworks RealPlayer 20/20. VideoLAN VLC media player. Any Web browser with RealPlayer plug-in Mac Eltima Elmedia Player. VideoLAN VLC media player. Any Web browser with RealPlayer plug-in Linux VideoLAN VLC media player. Any Web browser with RealPlayer plug-in.",
