    ".HYPETEMPLATE",
    "Hype Document Template",
    "3.0",
    "Document template created by Hype, an application used to create animated and interactive website content with HTML5; saves the layout of a website project, which may include text, graphics, and other content; can be exported to web files for publishing on a webpage; useful for creating multiple web content documents that use the same layout and theme. Mac Tumult Hype.",
