    "3.0",
    "Web page containing server-side scripts that enable the content to be generated dynamically when the page is loaded; used by Web pages on the Macys.com and Bloomingdales.com websites; for example, index.ognc?var1&var2.. Mac View in a Web browser Windows View in a Web browser.",
