    ".WBXML",
    "WAP Binary XML File",
    "3.0",
    "File created in the WAP (Wireless Application Protocol) Binary XML (WBXML) format, a compact binary file format used for transmitting XML documents over wireless mobile networks; allows mobile devices to preserve XML formatting while reducing the transmission time. Windows Qt SDK. Wbxml Parser for SYNCML. Mac Qt SDK. Linux libwbxml2-utils. Qt SDK.",
