    "2.9",
    "Collection of movies stored by Movie Collector; default name is mycollection.mvc. Windows Collectorz.com Movie Collector Mac Collectorz.com Movie Collector. An MVC file is a compiled script used by Miva Merchant Empresa, a web server application used to run Miva-based web programs. It contains a module or web application that has been compiled from an.MV file. MVC files are often used for deploying e-commerce programs on the web. Windows Miva Merchant Empresa. Linux Miva Merchant EmpresaFree.",
