    "Web application created with WebObjects, an enterprise framework developed by Apple; uses Java code and object-oriented design principles; can be deployed on any platform that supports Java programs. Web addresses that include .woa in the URL are generated using WebObjects. However, WebObjects pages do not necessarily require the .woa extension. Windows Run from a Web server Open in a Web browser Mac Run from a Web server Open in a Web browser Linux Run from a Web server Open in a Web browser.",
