    "Web page that may contain PHP code; PHP functions are parsed by a PHP engine on the Web server, which dynamically generates HTML; often used for accessing data from a database management system, such as MySQL. Most PHP pages use the standard.PHP extension. Windows Run on a Web server with PHP support View in a Web browser Edit with a text editor Mac Run on a Web server with PHP support View in a Web browser Edit with a text editor Adobe Dreamweaver 2021. MacroMates TextMateFree.",
