    "2.3",
    "Web page created with eSite Builder NXG, an online Web development environment that provides a WYSIWYG (What You See Is What You Get) interface for creating and updating Web pages; typically built from an eSite Builder NXG template. If a web address ends in .nxg, the webpage is most likely hosted on a server running eSite Builder. NOTE: Motorola eSite Builder NXG is no longer available for download. Windows Any Web browser Mac Any Web browser.",
