    ".QRM",
    "Qworum Message File",
    "2.3",
    "Message format used by Qworum, a platform for Web mashups; may be sent from one website to another to provide interactive services; formatted in XML and may contain RPC (remote procedure) calls. The content type of Qworum messages is application/xml (formerly application/x-qworum+xml, which is now obsolete). This identifier is used by Web browsers to process the Qworum message files. Windows Mozilla Firefox with Qworum plug-in. Google Chrome with Qworum plug-in. Microsoft Edge with Qworum plug-in. Mac Mozilla Firefox with Qworum plug-in. Google Chrome with Qworum plug-in. Linux Mozilla Firefox with Qworum plug-in. Google Chrome with Qworum plug-inFree.",
